        "comments": "The assembly csSphPapi3.1 is based on 62x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, the primary assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. This assembly appears to suggest that this species is a degraded diploid with weak interacting H-iC signal between putative homologous chromosomes. The karyotype is 1n = 42 (38 autosomes plus 1 larger and 3 smaller micro-chromosomes).",
